---
const { prefix = '' } = Astro.props;
---

<section class="precedent argument-block" aria-labelledby={`${prefix}precedent-heading`}>
  <h2 id={`${prefix}precedent-heading`}>The cryptography precedent</h2>
  <p>
    Modern cryptography made a similar shift. The field changed when researchers developed precise
    definitions of security, together with mechanisms, such as public-key encryption, digital
    signatures, and zero-knowledge proofs, that could satisfy those definitions under explicit
    theoretical assumptions. The resulting framework has endured decades of attack and scrutiny.
  </p>
  <p>
    RESI’s founders bring experience in cryptography, learning theory, and AI safety. Cryptographic
    results do not automatically transfer to AI or establish the safety of an entire system.
  </p>
  <a class="text-link" href="/#argument">
    Explore our approach
  </a>
</section>
